[en.FOCUS_C07_LPGG_CASINO]
Las Pegasus Casino

[en.FOCUS_C07_LPGG_CASINO_desc]
They say that “In Las Pegasus Casino, the house always wins.” But that’s simply not true. It is just a rumor. The original saying is: “In Las Pegasus Casino, they always win your house.”

[zh.FOCUS_C07_LPGG_CASINO]
洛马基赌场

[zh.FOCUS_C07_LPGG_CASINO_desc]
他们说“在洛马基赌场，庄家永远会赚。” 但这是不对的。这只是谣言。原话是：“在洛马基赌场，庄永远会赚到你的家。”

